  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Current gain is the ratio of change in output current divided by change in input current. For common CE (Common Emitter) configuration, it is the ratio of change in collector current divided by change in base current.</p><p>Current gain <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#39;</mo></mmultiscripts><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#39;</mo></mmultiscripts><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;A</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>av</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2000</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
